@baseUrl = http://localhost:5105
@id = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000

### Catalog
GET {{baseUrl}}/api

### Health
GET {{baseUrl}}/health/ready

### List customers
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/clientes?pagina=1&tamanhoPagina=20&ordenarPor=nome

### Create person
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/clientes
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: demo-joao

{
  "nome": "João da Silva",
  "tipoPessoa": "Fisica",
  "documento": "11144477735",
  "dataNascimento": "1985-03-10",
  "enderecos": [
    {
      "tipo": "Residencial",
      "logradouro": "Rua Augusta",
      "numero": "200",
      "bairro": "Consolação",
      "cidade": "São Paulo",
      "uf": "SP",
      "cep": "01305000",
      "principal": true
    }
  ],
  "contatos": [
    {
      "tipo": "Email",
      "valor": "joao@example.com",
      "principal": true
    }
  ]
}

### Get by document
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/clientes/documento/11144477735

### Add address
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/clientes/{{id}}/enderecos
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "tipo": "Comercial",
  "logradouro": "Avenida Paulista",
  "numero": "1578",
  "bairro": "Bela Vista",
  "cidade": "São Paulo",
  "uf": "SP",
  "cep": "01310200",
  "principal": false
}

### Summary report
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/relatorios/clientes/resumo

### CSV export
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/relatorios/clientes/exportar
